{"id":"n382599572d","headline":"Global Market: Japan’s Nikkei flat as investors await Fed, BOJ decisions","summary":"Japan's Nikkei was largely flat on Wednesday as investors stayed cautious ahead of interest-rate decisions from the US Federal Reserve and the Bank of Japan. Chip stocks weighed while energy and trading shares gained.","why":"The Nikkei 225 is Japan's benchmark stock index, heavily weighted toward technology and export companies sensitive to global rate policy and the yen.","category":"markets","event_type":"rates","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Tokyo","country":"Japan","lat":35.676,"lon":139.65,"region":"asia"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"The Economic Times","url":"https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/us-stocks/news/global-market-japans-nikkei-flat-as-investors-await-fed-boj-decisions/articleshow/134278817.cms"},"sources":[{"name":"The Economic Times","url":"https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/us-stocks/news/global-market-japans-nikkei-flat-as-investors-await-fed-boj-decisions/articleshow/134278817.cms"}],"published_at":"2026-09-16T05:24:00Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-12T08:33:11Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"277495645de7d25f","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-12T08:33:11Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-09-16T05:24:00Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-09-16T06:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"JA","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/stock-market-trading-screen-5782411.jpg","alt":"stock market trading screen (illustration)","credit":"TheInvestorPost","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/man-computer-stock-trading-iphone-5782411/"}}